    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274316</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あ……ここだ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh... This place...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>1</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274364</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>どーしたんだ？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>What's up?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>2</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274504</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ぼくがね、昔、
たくさん悪さしたって
言ったでしょ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Do you remember when I said I did a
lot of awful things a long time ago?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274504</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ここもそこのひとつ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>This was one of the places.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274504</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ここに建ってた家を
壊しちゃったんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I destroyed the house
that was here.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>3</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274572</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そっか……
でも、どうして……？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh... But, why?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>6</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274652</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>すごくイヤだったんだ、
自分が精霊だってこと</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I just really hated
being a spirit.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>7</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274728</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>精霊さんでもそんなこと
思ったりすんだね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>So even spirits have
feelings like that.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>8</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274896</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>他の精霊はたぶん
そんなふうに思わないよ、
きっと</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The other spirits probably
don't feel that way.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274896</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>イフリートもウンディーネも、
みんな元から自然界にいたのを
精霊王が引き出し精霊にした</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Efreet, Undine, and all the others were
pulled out of things that already existed
in nature, then made into spirits by our king.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>9</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>274952</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>精霊王……オリジン？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The king of spirits... Origin?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>11</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275068</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そう。だからもっと
超然としてる</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Right. So, they're
all indifferent to it.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275068</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でもぼくは違う。
瘴気の中から
新しく作られたんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But I was different. I was
pulled out and newly
created from the miasma.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>12</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275128</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>瘴気って、
魔界のやつだな</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The miasma? That
otherworld stuff?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>14</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275256</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そう。プルートが言ってたよね、
昔、一回、この世界が
魔界になったことがあるって</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Right. Like Pluto said, at one
time, a long time ago, this whole
world was like their daemon world.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275256</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>あの時に、ね</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>I was made then.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>15</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275304</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そうなんだ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>17</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275392</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>暗くて
もやもやしたところって
その瘴気の中だったんだ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Oh, I get it. That "dark
and hazy" place was
inside the miasma.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>18</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275644</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……新しく作られた
『音』を司る精霊、
グラムロック、それがぼく</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I was a newly created
spirit who governs
sound, "Glamrock."</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275644</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>なんで、ぼくは何のために
生まれたんだろう</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Why was I born?
For what purpose?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275644</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>精霊なんかに
生まれたんだろうって
悲しかった</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Being born as a spirit
only made me sad.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>2</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275644</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>他の精霊たちはそんなこと、
疑問に思ってないから、
誰も答えはくれない</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>The other spirits never
doubted their own purpose,
so they had no answer for me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>19</Id>
      <BubbleId>3</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275728</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>エトちゃんを作った
オリジンに聞けばよかったのに</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It would've been nice if you
could have asked Origin.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>23</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275860</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>オリジンもぼくを作った後、
姿を見せなくなったかラ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Origin never showed himself before
me again, after he created me.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275860</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……だから、ぼく、
ちょっと荒れてたんだ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...And so, I started
to become violent...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>24</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>275948</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>誰かに……自分の存在を
知ってもらいたくって……
だっけ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You just...wanted everyone
to know you existed... Isn't
what you said before?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>26</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276080</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うん……それと、
オリジンに
出てきてほしくて</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah...and also, I
hoped I could get
Origin to come back.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276080</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>オリジンは出てきたけど、
一緒にぼくの記憶も消した……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Origin did come back, but when
he did, he erased my memories...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>27</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276232</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも、ようやくわかったよ、
ぼくがどうして精霊だったか</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But, I finally understand.
Why I'm a spirit.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276232</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>きみたちを守るため。
あの暴走を止めて、
きみたちの助けをするため</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's so I can protect you.
So I can help you. So I
could stop the Prism Ring.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>29</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276316</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ええっ、『音』を司る精霊が、
それだけでいいのか？</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Huh... Shouldn't a "spirit who
governs sound" have a lot
more to do than just that?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>31</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276416</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>それ『だけ』じゃないよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's not "just" that.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276416</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ぼくにとっては、
それはとても大切なこと……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>For me, it's something
incredibly precious.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>32</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276480</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>でも……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>But...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276480</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……そうだね。うん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...That's a good point,
actually. Yes.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>34</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276552</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>えっ！　ちょ、ちょっと
何だよ、それ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Eh!? Hey, c'mon,
what's that about?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>36</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276608</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いいの。ほら、行くよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>It's fine. Anyway,
let's get going.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>3</SpeakerId>
      <Id>37</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276672</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>ひとりで勝手に
納得すんなよ！</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hey, what about me!? You can't
just decide all on your own!</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>2</SpeakerId>
      <Id>38</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276732</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いい子だね、&lt;Mel&gt;ちゃん</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Mel&gt;'s a good kid, isn't she?</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>39</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276784</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>&lt;Dio&gt;もいい子だよ</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>&lt;Dio&gt;'s a good kid, too.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>40</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276860</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>いい子たちに
出会えたんだね、エトちゃんは</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>You're lucky, Ethos, getting
to meet two kids like them.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>41</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276984</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>うん……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Yeah...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <BubbleId>0</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>276984</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>……何のために、生まれたか
なんて、わからくていいよ、
……うん……今は、まだ……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>...I don't need to know why I
was really born. ...At least...
for now...I'm happy with this.</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>1</SpeakerId>
      <Id>42</Id>
      <BubbleId>1</BubbleId>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
    <Entry>
      <PointerOffset>277028</PointerOffset>
      <JapaneseText>そっか……</JapaneseText>
      <EnglishText>Hmm...</EnglishText>
      <Notes/>
      <SpeakerId>4</SpeakerId>
      <Id>44</Id>
      <Status>Editing</Status>
    </Entry>
